\ proofs.fam — a block's chain proof checked (docs/NODE.md, step 6), after
\ arith.fam, poseidon2.fam, difficulty.fam, pow.fam, chainver.fam and
\ state.fam.  As tabminer's Statement::from_block and chain_output
\ (miner/src/aggregate.rs) and the sponges of block_air.rs: the public
\ values a block's chain proof is checked against are the program digest
\ (the base program's at height 1, the step's after) and the hash of the
\ height, the statement, the step digest and the plan root.  The statement
\ is the parent's state root and the block's, the sponge states over the
\ inputs' positions, the outputs, the name operations' digests and the
\ swept positions, the first and next output positions, the subsidy in
\ 16-bit limbs, the height, the parent's work (its pow_hash, nonce and
\ mix; genesis's mix computed from the seed file) and the parent's hash.
\
\ prinit ( consts genesis -- )  the chain's constants (24 canonical words:
\ the base program's digest, the step's, the plan root) and its genesis
\ header (stored, its work computed: powinit and cvinit first).
\ sproof ( -- flag )  within sconnect, after the supply: whether the block
\ being connected has a valid chain proof.

: prk variable ;  : pcs variable ;  : pin variable ;  : pvp variable ;  : ppub variable ;
: pgw variable ;  : ptmp variable ;  : ppar variable ;

: pv,  tom pvp @ !  pvp @ 4 lit + pvp ! ;     \ ( x -- )  a canonical value
: pvm,  pvp @ swap wcopy ;                     \ ( a n -- )  n Montgomery words (then pvp+)
: pvadv  2 lit lshift pvp @ + pvp ! ;          \ ( n -- )
: sp0  pcs @ 10 lit wzero  tom pcs @ 8 lit w! ;   \ ( dom -- )  a sponge, its domain in the capacity
: sab8  8 lit 0 lit do pcs @ i w@ over i w@ f+ pcs @ i w! loop drop  pcs @ perm16 ;   \ ( a -- )
\ sabpos ( lo hi -- )  a position: its low 30 bits and the rest.
: sabpos
over 3FFFFFFF lit and tom pcs @ @ f+ pcs @ !
swap 1E lit rshift swap 2 lit lshift or tom pcs @ 4 lit + @ f+ pcs @ 4 lit + !
pcs @ perm16 ;
: spcs,  pcs @ 10 lit pvm,  10 lit pvadv ;    \ the sponge's 16 words

: prinit  ( consts genesis -- )
400 lit alloc pin !  40 lit alloc pcs !  40 lit alloc ppub !  40 lit alloc pgw !  40 lit alloc ptmp !
CC lit alloc ppar !
swap 60 lit alloc dup prk ! 18 lit wcopy
\ genesis: stored, its pow_hash and true mix
stfd @ 1 lit txbegin stx !  dup 0 lit khdr swap CC lit sput  stx @ txcommit drop
dup pgw @ powhash
pgw @ swap AC lit + pgw @ 20 lit + pwr @ hashmix ;

\ sstmt ( -- flag )  sproof's public values in ppub (16 words: the
\ program's, then the statement's hash), from the parent's header in the
\ store (in the transaction open), the block's parsed fields and the
\ state's counters; 0 if the parent's header is missing.  sproof is it
\ and the verifier run on them; sync.fam runs the verifier in another
\ process (nodev) instead, the node serving meanwhile.
\ spar: if set, the parent's header (204 bytes) sstmt takes rather than
\ the store's (sync.fam's batches: a block's proof checked before its
\ parent is connected).
: spar variable ;
: sstmt  ( -- flag )
spar @ ?dup if ppar @ CC lit bcopy -1 lit else sh @ 1 lit - khdr ppar @ CC lit sget CC lit = then if
	pin @ pvp !
	sh @ pv,
	ppar @ 4C lit + pvp @ dle 8 lit pvadv
	bh @ 4C lit + pvp @ dle 8 lit pvadv
	21 lit sp0  bnin @ ?dup if 0 lit do bin @ i 5 lit * + pos@ sabpos loop then  spcs,
	22 lit sp0
	bnout @ ?dup if 0 lit do
		bout @ i 3C lit * +  dup ptmp @ dle  ptmp @ sab8
		ptmp @ 8 lit wzero  dup 20 lit + 5 lit 0 lit do dup i 2 lit lshift + le@ tom ptmp @ i w! loop drop
		34 lit + dup le@ swap 4 lit + le@
		over 3FFFFFFF lit and tom ptmp @ 5 lit w!
		over 1E lit rshift over 2 lit lshift or 3FFFFFFF lit and tom ptmp @ 6 lit w!
		nip 1C lit rshift tom ptmp @ 7 lit w!
		ptmp @ sab8
	loop then  spcs,
	\ the first position and the counter, 40 bits each: 30, then 10
	sfirst @ dup 3FFFFFFF lit and pv, 1E lit rshift sfirsth @ 2 lit lshift or pv,
	sctr @ dup 3FFFFFFF lit and pv, 1E lit rshift sctrh @ 2 lit lshift or pv,
	sh @ subsidy  over FFFF lit and pv,  swap 10 lit rshift pv,  dup FFFF lit and pv,  10 lit rshift pv,  0 lit pv,  0 lit pv,
	sh @ pv,
	23 lit sp0  bnops @ ?dup if 0 lit do bops @ i 3 lit lshift + ptmp @ opdigest ptmp @ sab8 loop then  spcs,
	24 lit sp0  bnsw @ ?dup if 0 lit do bsw @ i 5 lit * + pos@ sabpos loop then  spcs,
	sh @ 1 lit = if
		pgw @ 8 lit pvm, 8 lit pvadv
		ppar @ AC lit + 20 lit pvp @ pack3 B lit pvadv
		pgw @ 20 lit + 8 lit pvm, 8 lit pvadv
	else
		ppar @ pvp @ powhash 8 lit pvadv
		ppar @ AC lit + 20 lit pvp @ pack3 B lit pvadv
		ppar @ 8C lit + pvp @ dle 8 lit pvadv
	then
	bh @ pvp @ dle 8 lit pvadv
	prk @ 20 lit + pvp @ dtom 8 lit pvadv
	prk @ 40 lit + pvp @ dtom 8 lit pvadv
	pin @ pvp @ pin @ - 2 lit rshift ptmp @ hash  ptmp @ dfrom
	sh @ 1 lit = if prk @ else prk @ 20 lit + then ppub @ 8 lit wcopy
	ptmp @ ppub @ 20 lit + 8 lit wcopy
	-1 lit
else 0 lit then ;
: sproof  ( -- flag )  sstmt blite @ 0= and if ppub @ bpr @ bnpr @ cvverify else 0 lit then ;
